WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:09.958
Odell said I’m a murderer?

00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:12.833
Haha, well that’s just our relationship, you know?

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:17.000
I mean, it’s not like

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.125
you can draft a QB over Saquon!

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:20.791
Yeah, I think they probably should have

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:22.166
Look, I love the fans

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:23.375
I would never harm a fan

00:00:23.375 --> 00:00:24.666
But do I think they protect Eli?

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:26.583
YEAH, WELL HOW MANY RINGS HAS ODELL GIVEN US?

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:28.791
Eli won two Super Bowls against us

00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:31.666
So now they are stuck with him forever

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:34.291
Rumors are, there’s tension

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:37.291
Eli, can you pass more to your best receiver?

00:00:37.291 --> 00:00:39.458
No. We must only checkdown.

00:00:39.458 --> 00:00:41.208
No comment! No comment!

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:42.791
But yes, I am loving this

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.083
BEN, GET OVER HERE

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:45.541
YOU WON’T BELIEVE WHAT GRUDEN DID NOW

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:46.791
Yeah, we don’t even need to be good

00:00:46.791 --> 00:00:47.916
to win this division anymore

00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:50.208
Look, I barely killed the Giants!

00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:51.583
I’m not capable!

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.000
Coach, I’m here to bail you out again

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.791
OK, sorry, I have to have my family

00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:55.583
yell at the Maras

00:00:55.583 --> 00:00:56.083
Goodbye

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.875
What the hell did I do?

00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.958
Ruined the Giants, of course

